    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d99">

                <pb facs="0214" n="126" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg126"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Peking,
                                China</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1904-02-27"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">February 27, 1904</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1522.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my No. 1509 of February 23, in
                    regard to the reply of the Russian Government to the United States concerning
                    the neutrality of China and the limitation of the zone of hostilities, and
                    inclosing copy of the note communicating the information to the Chinese
                    Government, I inclose herewith translation of the reply received this day from
                    the foreign office, and have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">E. H. Conger.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d99-a1.xml" xpointer="d99-a1"/>
